      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Last of Us</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Updated November 13, 2022:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This story is now marked as completed! It is set up as a prequel for the real story which will be published later as I write more content for it!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A woman stolen from her husband. A prophecy about the best of the Etherians. A legendary warâ€¦&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora always knew her life hung in a balance. She had heard prophecies hung over her like storm clouds. But when a young, banished magicat appears in her life, suddenly those prophecies donâ€™t matter anymore&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OR&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Trojan War (prequel) story no one asked for, where Adora is Achilles (but not a dick) and Catra is Patroclus&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
